[Desktop Entry]
Name=WhatHush
GenericName=Multi-account messaging
GenericName[fr]=Messagerie multi-comptes
Comment=Several WhatsApp Web accounts side by side, with Snooze, Focus and deep sleep. Independent project, not affiliated with WhatsApp or Meta.
Comment[fr]=Plusieurs comptes WhatsApp Web côte à côte, avec Snooze, Focus et veille profonde. Projet indépendant, non affilié à WhatsApp ni à Meta.
Exec=whathush %U
Icon=io.github.chapdel.mcdesk
Terminal=false
Type=Application
Categories=Network;InstantMessaging;Chat;
Keywords=whatsapp;messaging;chat;multi-account;snooze;
Keywords[fr]=whatsapp;messagerie;chat;multi-comptes;snooze;
StartupWMClass=io.github.chapdel.mcdesk
MimeType=x-scheme-handler/whatsapp;
